OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPatchy rain
OL,6,Fturning heavy at times overnight,
OL,7,Fbefore clearing from the west towards
OL,8,Fdawn, but perhaps lingering around the
OL,9,Feast coast come dawn. Brisk southerly
OL,10,Fwinds easing overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FAny persistent rain around
OL,13,Fthe east coast soon clearing.
OL,14,FOtherwise a mix of isolated showers
OL,15,Fand brighter spells during the
OL,16,Fmorning, with outbreaks building for
OL,17,Fafternoon from the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
